      {
        "id": 17677,
        "title": "Classes de Objetos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149884,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>À medida que construímos jogos, precisaremos criar muitos objetos semelhantes, mas distintos. Por exemplo, muitos inimigos em um nível.</p><p>Mas criar um novo objeto para milhares de inimigos levaria muito tempo e poderia levar a erros.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy100 = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy100);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149885,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para tornar esse processo menos propenso a erros e mais eficiente, podemos usar estruturas de dados chamadas <strong>classes</strong> como modelos.<br /></p><p>Depois de criarmos um template com as propriedades que queremos para todos os objetos semelhantes, podemos usá-lo para criar novos objetos mais rapidamente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149886,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para criar uma nova classe, começamos com a palavra-chave <code>class</code>, um nome e chaves.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>class</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149887,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sempre que criamos uma nova classe, temos que garantir que o nome comece com uma <strong>letra maiúscula</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"enemy\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Enemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149888,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para criar novos objetos, as classes precisam de um método especial chamado <code>constructor()</code>. Este método define os valores das propriedades para um novo objeto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149889,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Precisamos de uma maneira de especificar os valores únicos que um novo objeto terá. Fazemos isso enviando <strong>parâmetros</strong> para o método construtor.</p><p>Aqui, vamos passar o <code>type</code> e depois <code>health</code> como parâmetros para o método construtor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"type; health\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>type, health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149890,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que são <strong>classes</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Modelos para objetos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Objetos bem definidos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Modelos para objetos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149891,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que usamos classes?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eles nos permitem criar objetos mais rapidamente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">São mais curtos de escrever do que objetos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eles nos permitem criar objetos mais rapidamente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149892,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao criar uma classe, qual convenção de nomenclatura é importante?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os nomes das classes começam com uma letra maiúscula</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há necessidade de um nome de classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os nomes das classes começam com uma letra maiúscula.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149893,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o método que usamos dentro de uma classe para criar novos objetos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>constructor()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new Object()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>constructor</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149894,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os parâmetros devem estar no construtor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma classe pode ter apenas um parâmetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os parâmetros devem estar no construtor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149895,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma classe para <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Class\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>class</code> seguido de <code>Player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149896,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dê à sua classe <code>Player</code> um <code>constructor</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>constructor</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149897,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione alguns parâmetros à classe <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>name,</code> seguido de <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17678,
        "title": "Este",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Antes de criar uma nova propriedade de objeto de jogo, precisamos de uma palavra-chave especial: <code>this</code>. Adicionamos a palavra-chave <code>this</code> para nos referirmos ao objeto que está sendo criado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para criar uma nova propriedade de objeto de jogo, precisamos usar a palavra-chave <code>this</code> seguida de um ponto e o nome da propriedade.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>this</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e finalmente <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para terminar de criar a nova propriedade do objeto do jogo, vamos atribuir o parâmetro <code>name</code> como um valor para <code>this.name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>name</code> e finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hora de usar nossa classe. Começamos da mesma forma que criaríamos uma constante, mas então adicionamos a palavra-chave <code>new</code> seguida por <code>Player()</code>.</p><p>Aqui vamos atribuir <code>new Player()</code> à constante <code>player1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"128\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>new</code> seguido de <code>Player</code> e finalmente <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos então adicionar os valores que queremos definir para o novo jogador dentro dos parênteses.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aí está! Podemos usar classes para criar quantos jogadores quisermos agora, com muito menos código.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Blaze&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é a palavra-chave que precisamos especificar em uma classe para informar ao código que estamos nos referindo ao objeto de jogo que estamos criando atualmente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>class</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma classe tem uma propriedade <code>score</code>. Como acessamos essa propriedade quando estamos dentro da classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Com <code>this.score</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Com <code>this(score)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Com <code>this.score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual trecho de código é a maneira correta de criar um novo objeto <code>Enemy</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>new Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>new Enemy(\"Slime\", 20);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma nova propriedade de objeto chamada <code>health</code> usando <code>this</code>. Dê a ela o valor do parâmetro <code>health</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>this</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>health</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o código para criar uma nova propriedade de objeto chamada <code>type</code> usando <code>this</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>this.type</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
